{
  "id": "gov.pension",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": {
    "en": "Pension: sanction, PPO and monthly disbursement",
    "hi": "पेंशन: स्वीकृति, पीपीओ एवं मासिक भुगतान"
  },
  "domain": "IFMS",
  "description": "Pension papers: computation by rule, service verification, Head of Office sanction, authorisation by the Accountant General / PAO with objections returned under the same case (GP-50), PPO issue and entry in the pension roll; monthly disbursement one instance per pensioner with life-certificate hold (GP-30, GP-09).",
